    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open your humble food stand in a lively Algerian neighborhood and begin your journey into the world of traditional street food!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Gargouti Simulator</i>, you play as the owner of a small local food shop deep in the heart of an authentic Algerian neighborhood. Your mission? Cook up beloved street dishes like <i>Karantika, French fry sandwiches, and omelettes</i> \u2014 all while dealing with quirky customers, tight timing, and the chaotic charm of everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a cooking game \u2014 it\u2019s an immersive slice-of-life experience where you\u2019ll explore Algerian food culture, manage your shop, and climb your way to becoming the true <i>King of the Gargouti</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfe Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f <strong>Authentic Algerian atmosphere</strong>: Inspired by real neighborhoods, with local signs, decor, and casual street vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf74 <strong>Discover traditional food</strong>: Prepare Karantika, French fry sandwiches, omelettes, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 <strong>Quirky customer interactions</strong>: Get praised \u2014 or roasted \u2014 based on your performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Realistic tools and appliances</strong>: Use grills, spatulas, gas stoves, soda fridges, and sauce bottles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Local music and sound design</strong>: Adds a vibrant and immersive Algerian flavor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you keep up with the rush, satisfy your customers, and make your little shop the pride of the neighborhood?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your skills and experience the everyday flavor of Algerian street life in Gargouti Simulator!</strong></p></li></ul>",
